From: Sean O'Hollaren <sean.ohollaren@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 23:51:23 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 05/11] FM-1: device build support (constant short-pointer
 base, device panic, C++ shims)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/fm1/fm1.h              |  6 +++---
 src/fm1/fm1_controls.c     |  2 +-
 src/fm1/fm1_platform.c     |  6 +++++-
 src/fm1/fm1_sdk.c          | 11 +++++++++++
 src/fm1/fm1_web.c          |  8 ++++----
 src/fm1/shim/cxx/algorithm |  6 ++++++
 src/fm1/shim/cxx/atomic    |  2 ++
 src/fm1/shim/cxx/cassert   |  1 +
 src/fm1/shim/cxx/cstdint   |  1 +
 src/fm1/shim/cxx/cstdio    |  1 +
 src/fm1/shim/cxx/cstdlib   |  1 +
 src/fm1/shim/cxx/cstring   |  1 +
 src/fm1/shim/cxx/set       |  2 ++
 13 files changed, 39 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/fm1/shim/cxx/algorithm
 create mode 100644 src/fm1/shim/cxx/atomic
 create mode 100644 src/fm1/shim/cxx/cassert
 create mode 100644 src/fm1/shim/cxx/cstdint
